      "title_size": "h3",
      "title_align": "left",
      "section": "Catalog coverage",
      "order": 1,
      "alignment": "left",
      "vertical_alignment": "center",
      "body": "Every data collection here is generated from **depictio/catalog/**: one per distinct recipe, one per recipe-free output, plus a synthetic MultiQC report. It exists so the catalog e2e suite covers every module the catalog declares, rather than whatever the nf-core reference projects happen to ingest. Regenerate with `scripts/generate_project.py` after adding a module.\n",
      "wf_tag": "python/catalog_conformance"
    },
