      "last_updated": "2026-05-12T00:00:00.000000",
      "title_size": "h3",
      "title_align": "left",
      "section": "Raw lane",
      "order": 1,
      "alignment": "left",
      "vertical_alignment": "center",
      "body": "Both tiles below come from collections depictio recognised **without running a recipe**: the MultiQC report was matched on its `path_glob`, the MetaPhlAn profile on its find block. Nothing was joined or reshaped \u2014 what you see is the file, read. This is the lane most pipelines land in, and the one that breaks first when a tool changes its output path.\n",
      "wf_tag": "python/catalog_conformance"
    },
